OL,3,ANew Zealand opposition leader says
OL,4,Aparties will need to 'work together' as
OL,5,Avote count shows tight race
OL,6,
OL,7,FVotes are being counted in New Zealand,
OL,8,Fwith incumbent PM Christopher Luxon's
OL,9,FNational Party and Chris Hipkins'
OL,10,FLabour Party currently neck-and-neck
OL,12,FHipkins tells supporters at an election
OL,13,Fnight watch party that the direction of
OL,14,Fthe vote is not yet clear, and the next
OL,15,FParliament will need to "work together"
OL,16,Fand "find a common ground"
OL,18,FThe latest electoral commission data
OL,19,Fsuggests a slight lead for National -
OL,20,Fhere's why we won't know the full
OL,21,Fresults until later this month
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
